---
/**
 * Systems.astro — Phase 5
 *
 * The heart of the site (brief: "quiero convertir esta sección en el
 * corazón del sitio"). Retired the flat nine-row ranked list. The visible
 * structure is now doc 16 Part 1's six capabilities, expanded — not
 * replaced — into six editorial chapters (docs/18 Part 7). Every system
 * still lives in exactly the capability doc 16 already assigned it as
 * primary or secondary evidence; nothing was reclassified.
 *
 * Each chapter deliberately uses a different composition (brief: "no
 * tengas miedo de romper el layout entre categorías") — a dark full-force
 * feature, a quiet spacious one, a two-column diagram, a diptych, a
 * compact three-up poster, and a calm closing feature. Six different
 * grids, one visual language (same tokens, same type system, same
 * ArchitectureStrip/disclosure mechanics throughout).
 *
 * The isotipo appears here as a mask (docs/18 Part 4, row 3) — every
 * chapter anchor's preview is clipped to the parallelogram silhouette
 * (ProjectPreview `masked`) instead of the standard hairline frame. One
 * technique, six quiet instances, never the flat watermark.
 */

